000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. HELLO.
000030*> Smoke test for the stock GnuCOBOL build: packed decimal,
000040*> edited pictures, EVALUATE, inline PERFORM, STRING, ref-mod.
000050 DATA DIVISION.
000060 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000070 01  WS-GROSS        PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 1234.56.
000080 01  WS-RATE         PIC SV9(4)   COMP-3 VALUE .0765.
000090 01  WS-TAX          PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
000100 01  WS-CHECK-AMT    PIC $***,**9.99.
000110 01  WS-I            PIC 9(2).
000120 01  WS-NAME         PIC X(20) VALUE "WANG VS-45".
000130 01  WS-LINE         PIC X(60).
000140 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000150     DISPLAY "Hello from COBOL!"
000160     COMPUTE WS-TAX ROUNDED = WS-GROSS * WS-RATE
000170     MOVE WS-TAX TO WS-CHECK-AMT
000180     DISPLAY "Tax on 1234.56 at 7.65%: " WS-CHECK-AMT
000190     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 3
000200         EVALUATE WS-I
000210             WHEN 1 DISPLAY "  one"
000220             WHEN 2 DISPLAY "  two"
000230             WHEN OTHER DISPLAY "  many"
000240         END-EVALUATE
000250     END-PERFORM
000260     STRING "Machine: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
000270            WS-NAME(1:4) DELIMITED BY SIZE
000280            INTO WS-LINE
000290     END-STRING
000300     DISPLAY WS-LINE
000310     STOP RUN.
